WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.775
On a number line, further left is less.

2
00:00:03.401 --> 00:00:06.651
Negative three is left of two, so it is less.

3
00:00:07.203 --> 00:00:10.903
Now move A to negative seven, and B to negative two.

4
00:00:22.752 --> 00:00:26.952
Negative seven is further left, so it is less than negative two.
